# The study content is a SQLite database. Told that it is binary, git will not try
# to merge it; told how to dump it, git will still show a readable diff.
#
# The textconv driver is per-clone, so run this once after cloning:
#   git config diff.sqlite.textconv 'sqlite3 "$1" .dump'
*.sqlite3 binary diff=sqlite

# The extracted guide is one very long line by design, see bin/guide-text.sh.
# A line diff on it says nothing, so git is told not to try.
content/exam-guide.txt -diff
*.pdf binary
